          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A right circular cone is generated when a right triangle is rotated about one of its legs. The relationship among the slant length l, the height h, the radius r of the base is"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.488,
            0.797,
            0.51
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "l ^ { 2 } = h ^ { 2 } + r ^ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (using the Baudhāyana–Pythagoras theorem)"
            }
          ]
        },
